commit bcdba1fe400e97bab376b80a223bd6319082c831

C03: the retry hint is chosen from the full rejection reason, so payload-fact defects reach the model (APPS1387)

APPS1383 and UI1373 measured the same loop: a draft rejected by a payload-fact defect (missing_prior_open «Son las 05:31.», missing_click_verb «Apagué el 5») was retried with the generic contract hint, because the composer looked the hint up only by the visible-defect name, and the model repeated the same draft until the retries ran out.

llm.compose_user_message: the defect used to select the retry hint is the full rejection reason (visible defect, copied instruction, truncated fact word, payload-fact defect, imperative echo, promised effect), the same name the audit records. No fixed reply.

No .NET change. Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


